<title>SOUTH AFRICA: EL Bateman half yr headline shr surges.</title>
<headline>EL Bateman half yr headline shr surges.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to December 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr:</p>
<p>    - headline (cts)	  28.0    vs   12.4</p>
<p>    - attributable (cts)    36.4    vs   22.1</p>
